<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/ThePoolLab.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://cdn.fluidrausa.com/-/media/media-database/products/cleaners/polaris-p39/p39_1.png?rev=369f337662f24b9ebb56f3a33acc0e4f"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin=""/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-4dbbcf07a05c3f48.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/472-6eced84fcf03e6a3.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-ce281d8555633725.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js" async=""></script><title>Polaris P39 Review - The Pool Lab</title><meta name="description" content="A pressure-side cleaner that works in all in-ground pools and sweeps, scrubs, and vacuums the bottom and walls."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/reviews/Polaris-P39"/><meta property="og:title" content="Polaris P39 Review"/><meta property="og:description" content="A pressure-side cleaner that works in all in-ground pools and sweeps, scrubs, and vacuums the bottom and walls."/><meta property="og:image" content="https://cdn.fluidrausa.com/-/media/media-database/products/cleaners/polaris-p39/p39_1.png?rev=369f337662f24b9ebb56f3a33acc0e4f"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><div class="container my-5"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8"><h1 class="mb-3">Polaris P39<!-- -->: In-Depth Review</h1><div class="text-center mb-4 p-3 bg-white rounded border" style="height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://cdn.fluidrausa.com/-/media/media-database/products/cleaners/polaris-p39/p39_1.png?rev=369f337662f24b9ebb56f3a33acc0e4f" alt="Polaris P39" class="img-fluid" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain;width:auto;height:auto"/></div><p class="lead">The Polaris P39 is a different beast entirely. It is a **pressure-side** cleaner, meaning it requires a dedicated booster pump to operate. While this makes installation more complex, it offers unrivaled power for picking up large debris. It is widely considered the best pressure-side cleaner on the market, combining the classic Polaris reliability with modern aerodynamics and a dual-chamber bag.</p><h3 class="mt-5">Who This Is For</h3><div><p>The P39 is the specific choice for:</p><ul><li>Pools that <strong>already have a booster pump</strong> installed.</li><li>Owners dealing with <strong>heavy leaf loads</strong> and large debris.</li><li>Those who prefer the reliability of a non-robotic (no electronics in the water) system.</li><li>Pools where fine dust is less of a concern than acorns and twigs.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Who Should Skip It</h3><div><p>Definitely skip this if:</p><ul><li><strong>You don't have a booster pump:</strong> Installing one costs hundreds of dollars. Buy a robotic cleaner instead.</li><li><strong>You want energy efficiency:</strong> Running a booster pump + main pump uses significantly more electricity than a low-voltage robot.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Key Features</h3><div><ul><li><strong>Pressure-Side Operation:</strong> Powered by a dedicated booster pump for massive suction.</li><li><strong>PosiDrive Chain:</strong> Stainless steel chain drive for durable, slip-free traction.</li><li><strong>Wide Trax Tires:</strong> Provides superior grip on walls and floors.</li><li><strong>TailSweep Pro:</strong> Included tail scrubber sweeps the floor without spraying water out of the pool.</li><li><strong>Dual-Chamber SuperBag:</strong> Massive capacity for leaves and large debris.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Detailed Analysis</h3><div><p><strong>Hydraulic Power:</strong> The P39 uses the water pressure from your booster pump to create a venturi effect, sucking debris into its bag. Because it doesn't have an onboard motor or computer, there are fewer delicate parts to break. It's purely mechanical, which many long-time pool owners prefer for its longevity.</p><p><strong>PosiDrive System:</strong> Unlike older belt-driven Polaris models (like the 280), the P39 uses a stainless steel chain drive. This eliminates belt stretching and slipping, providing consistent torque to the wheels for better climbing and maneuvering.</p><p><strong>Dual-Chamber Bag:</strong> The SuperBag collects 40% more debris than standard bags. Its dual-chamber design prevents debris from getting trapped in the intake, ensuring suction remains strong even when the bag is nearly full of leaves.</p></div><div class="row mt-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-success h-100"><div class="card-header bg-success text-white">Pros</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Unbeatable for large leaves and acorns</li><li class="list-group-item">Extremely durable with few electronic parts</li><li class="list-group-item">TailSweep Pro prevents wet windows/decks</li><li class="list-group-item">Fast cleaning cycles (often under 2 hours)</li><li class="list-group-item">Chain drive is virtually maintenance-free</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-danger h-100"><div class="card-header bg-danger text-white">Cons</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Requires a dedicated booster pump (high energy cost)</li><li class="list-group-item">Not a &#x27;robotic&#x27; cleaner (no smart mapping)</li><li class="list-group-item">Does not filter fine dust as well as cartridges</li><li class="list-group-item">Bag must be emptied frequently during leaf season</li></ul></div></div></div><h3 class="mt-5">Final Verdict</h3><p>If your pool setup includes a booster pump and you live in a wooded area, the Polaris P39 is likely your best bet. It handles heavy biological debris better than any robotic cartridge cleaner ever could. It&#x27;s a brute-force tool for a messy job. However, for most modern pools without a booster pump, a robotic cleaner like the Dolphin Nautilus is a more energy-efficient and easier-to-install solution.</p></div><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="card sticky-top" style="top:20px"><div class="card-body text-center"><h5 class="card-title">Polaris P39</h5><p class="card-text">Ready to buy? Get the best price online.</p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GWSJMQ6?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 ">Check Price on Amazon</a><small class="text-muted d-block mt-2">We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.</small></div><div class="card mt-4"><div class="card-header bg-light fw-bold">Consider These Alternatives</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Premier">Dolphin Premier</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->1599</span></li><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport">Polaris 9650iQ Sport</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->1099</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</small></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin="" asy